      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg i just got the worst headache of my entire life. like it literally hit me like a hammer out of nowhere and i'm kinda panicking. it's so intense i can barely see straight. is this just a really bad migraine or something? i'm scared to go to the hospital if it's not serious",
